# Closed production build context for the public Corresponding Source tree.
#
# Docker reads this file with last-match-wins semantics, and re-including a
# directory ("!dir/") re-includes everything under it.  So reopen files and
# runtime trees by exact path only, never a bare directory, and put every deny
# that must also hold inside a reopened tree after the reopens.
# scripts/verification/verify_docker_context.py checks every reopened path
# against the Dockerfile's COPY sources and deploy/image-app-tree.json, and that
# sensitive paths stay denied.
**

# Docker control files and project/third-party notices.
!.dockerignore
!LICENSE
!THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md

# Runtime Python source and immutable runtime data.
!backend/app/**
!backend/ephe/**
!backend/place_data/**

# Exact Docker build inputs.
!deploy/Dockerfile
!deploy/requirements.lock
!deploy/build-requirements.lock
!deploy/ephemeris.sha256
!deploy/frontend-contract.json
!deploy/entrypoint.sh
!deploy/container_healthcheck.py

# Exact native source archive consumed by the builder.
!third_party/pyswisseph/pyswisseph-2.10.3.2.tar.gz

# The hash-checked wheels build_release_image writes into the snapshot.
!wheelhouse/*.whl

# Exact build/runtime verifiers copied by the Dockerfile.
!scripts/verification/verify_ephemeris_integrity.py
!scripts/verification/verify_place_catalog.py

# Final deny rules: they follow the reopens because Docker uses the last match.
# Hidden paths (.env, .git, .venv, .DS_Store, ...) anywhere, then the control
# file that is itself hidden.
**/.*
!.dockerignore
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/tests
**/dist
**/[Rr][Ee][Aa][Dd][Mm][Ee].[Mm][Dd]
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*secret*
**/*token*
